  description: "Windrazor evolved from airborne microorganisms used in atmospheric
    filtration systems. Energy surges altered their cellular structure, granting
    them razor-sharp motion control. They hunt by riding pressure waves, slicing
    targets before they can react. Their presence marks areas where the lab\u2019s
    air systems completely collapsed."
